  "releaseNotes": "TinyEvents.Worker 1.0.0-beta.1\n\n      Added\n      - Independent hosted cleanup service for bounded processed-message retention.\n      - Configurable cleanup enablement, retention, batch size, and interval.\n\n      Hardened\n      - Cleanup failures remain isolated from event processing.\n      - Worker and cleanup options validate their active capabilities without blocking custom providers that disable cleanup.\n      - Package smoke tests exercise both hosted services through public registration.\n\n      Compatibility\n      - Evidence-backed pre-1.0 beta with documented at-least-once boundaries.\n      - Requires matching beta.1 TinyEvents core and database provider packages.",
